 rataflow-view · 165x40 @100% · modal-runtime-canvas.json · 11 nodes · 8 edges · q quit

                      worker and runtime: the two RPC seams
                      Task input plus control RPCs go down to modal-runtime; events plus management RPCs come back. Two directed seams, never one merged arrow.

                      ╭─────────────╮                                  ╭────────────╮
                      │             │◀─────────────────────────────────│            │
                      │modal-runtime│     task input + control RPCs    │modal-worker│
                      │             │───╮ events + management RPCs   ╭▶│            │
                      ╰─────────────╯   ╰────────────────────────────╯ ╰────────────╯


                      ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
                      task dispatch down to the container
                      modal-runtime dispatches tasks to the Task engine, which starts and manages a Container backend that runs the user process in the Task containe

                      ╭─────────────╮                   ╭───────────╮                   ╭─────────────────╮                    ╭──────────────╮
                      │modal-runtime│──────────────────▶│Task engine│──────────────────▶│Container backend│───────────────────▶│Task container│
                      │             │ dispatches tasks  │           │ starts / manages  │                 │ runs user process  │              │
                      ╰─────────────╯                   ╰───────────╯                   ╰─────────────────╯                    ╰──────────────╯


                      ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
                      storage and daemon interfaces
                      The engine mounts and snapshots Filesystem + volumes, whose data flows to Blobnet; modal-runtime reaches modal-daemon over filesystem HTTP on U

                       ╭───────────╮                            ╭────────────────────╮
                       │Task engine│───────────────────────────▶│Filesystem + volumes│────────────────────╮
                       │           │    mounts / snapshots      │                    │ image + volume data│
                       ╰───────────╯                            ╰────────────────────╯                    │ ╭───────╮
                                                                                                          ╰▶│Blobnet│
                      ╭─────────────╮   filesystem HTTP over UDS    ╭────────────╮                          │       │
                      │modal-runtime│──────────────────────────────▶│modal-daemon│                          ╰───────╯
